e most recent value. We had freedom to come up with our own design as long as we were able to provide availability and linearizability at the same time (that is, to the extent that the tester can test). The exception was partitioning and replication, which should be done exactly the way Dynamo does.","topics":[],"score":212337,"global_rank":262602},{"name":"Venkteshkavi/Algorithms-DataStructures-Efficient-Practices","owner":"Venkteshkavi","html_url":"https://github.com/Venkteshkavi/Algorithms-DataStructures-Efficient-Practices","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This repository contains some interesting leetcode and programming problems","topics":[],"score":212337,"global_rank":262603},{"name":"isalevine/java-tic-tac-toe","owner":"isalevine","html_url":"https://github.com/isalevine/java-tic-tac-toe","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212337,"global_rank":262611},{"name":"clarisaleu/SimpleTodo","owner":"clarisaleu","html_url":"https://github.com/clarisaleu/SimpleTodo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Java","description":"Android App To Do List","topics":[],"score":212337,"global_rank":262629},{"name":"nottu/skyviewmods","owner":"nottu","html_url":"https://github.com/nottu/skyviewmods","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"An easy and automated way to add new surveys to skyview","topics":["astronomy","skyview"],"score":212337,"global_rank":262652},{"name":"eddie-wang/LeetCode","owner":"eddie-wang","html_url":"https://github.com/eddie-wang/LeetCode","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"My answers for problems on LeetCode","topics":[],"score":212335,"global_rank":262657},{"name":"knowitall/kbp-MultiR","owner":"knowitall","html_url":"https://github.com/knowitall/kbp-MultiR","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[]